# Ship to main

- Commit and push directly to `main` — no PR workflow, no feature branches unless parallel work needs isolation.
- Do not run unit tests (`npm test`) or start a local dev server (`npm run dev`, localhost) before shipping unless the user explicitly asks.
- Vercel production build on push is the verification gate.
- Still update e2e/unit test files when behaviour changes; just do not run them locally before merge.
